              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitcmonok Yosep agalike, kolot airiamakin ka Isirael papake, toma Gosen; kitodikin mama ejai, kibirokin omurisiŋike, komony akiyo komurisinike apak naepol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.29",
